HOW TO INSTALL IN ROBLOX STUDIO:

1. ReplicatedStorage
   • Create a Folder named: MM2CoinSystem
   • Inside it create a RemoteEvent named: CollectCoin

2. ServerScriptService
   • Create a normal Script
   • Copy the entire SERVER CODE section (marked clearly below) into it

3. StarterPlayer → StarterPlayerScripts
   • Create a LocalScript
   • Copy the entire CLIENT CODE section into it

4. Workspace
   • Create several Parts
   • Name them exactly: TestCoin
   • Anchored = true, CanCollide = false (recommended)

